    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ULTIMATE TOOL ASSISTED BULLSHITTING KEYBOARD DESTRUCTION RHYTHM GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of egregiously cheating at an extremely hard 8 button rhythm game! Worried about hitting the right button? Any key on the same half of your keyboard will do. Unbelievably fast streams? Just hit them as chords, it's fine. GODHAND takes care of all that pesky &quot;thinking&quot; so you can concentrate on the important stuff: rapidly smashing your keyboard like a crazed gorilla.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But of course, there have to be limits to such overpowered abilities. Too many inputs will fill up the heat gauge, which <i>*checks notes*</i> vastly increases your score...? Who came up with this??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978440/extras/b1cb9677778ad8fa85ae21c9ecd5776e.avif?t=1755200027\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In GODHAND's Early Access version, experience 25 stages of keyboard smashing to cute pop songs, really fast hardcore, and really really really fast hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(if you destroy your keyboard in the game, you destroy your keyboard in real life.)</i></p>",
